        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F60PLY, Plymouth Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPrimarily used on front doors, this Schlage made handleset features oval mounts on the outside. Available in an array finishes, the Plymouth Handleset is a fine example of sophistication; but do not be fooled into thinking that functionality and quality have been sacrificed in the name of beauty. When you have a Schlage handleset on your front door, you know your home is secure. This handleset features ANSI Grade 1 security and has solid brass construction on the exterior. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is key operated from the exterior and by a turn knob on interior while a thumbpiece operates the latch underneath the deadbolt from the exterior and a turnknob operates it from the interior. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching:\r\n<a href=\"/products/plymouth-dummy-cylinder-handleset-schlage-f93ply\"><b>Plymouth Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Plymouth Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.5 Grade 1 security.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>All metal chassis for strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>3 screw door frame reinforcer.</li>\r\n<li>C keyway comes packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n<li>Outside Trim: Handlesets are solid forged brass; wrought brass trim rings with concealed security inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Inside Trim: are zinc-based plated to match finishes indicated.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable throughbolt can move up and down 1-1/2\" to fit a variety of pre-existing holes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Oval Single Cylinder Plymouth Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rage of Door Preparation: 4\" to 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Total Height: 18-1/16\" (with 5-1/2\" door prep)</li> \r\n<li>Exterior Total Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Center to Center Grip Range: adjustable 8-3/8\" to 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Height: 3-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Escutcheon Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Grip Escutcheon Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Height: 12-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: will fit 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: will fit 1-5/8\" up to 1-3/4\" packaged with extra screws to accommodate 2\" doors</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCH-PLY-specifications.pdf?v=1704262151\"><b>Schlage Plymouth Exterior Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.The Orbit Knob is not available in Antique Brass, Antique Pewter, Matte Black, or  Aged Bronze.  The Georgian Knob is not available in Satin Chrome. The Elan Lever is not available in Antique Pewter. The Flair Lever is not available in Matte Black. \r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
